<!--
    PUF France B2G Use Case 13: Subcontracting with Direct Payment
    (Sous-traitance avec paiement direct - commande publique B2G)

    Use Case: A subcontractor requests direct payment from a public buyer and identifies the contract holder as Seller Agent.
    Country: France
    Format: PUF (Pagero Universal Format) 2.0
    Document Type: Invoice (Type 380)
    Transaction Type: S3 - B2G subcontractor direct-payment request
    Target Format: France UBL EXTENDED-CTC-FR V1.4

    Reference: XP Z12-014 Annexe A, Section 3.2.12.3 - Cas n°13

    Scenario Description:
    - A SUBCONTRACTOR invoices a PUBLIC BUYER and requests direct payment through Chorus Pro.
    - The MAIN CONTRACTOR / contract holder is identified as Seller Agent.
    - This is the B2G S3 variant, distinct from the existing S5 private-market delegation example.

    Key Requirements:
    - Business process BT-23 = S3: subcontractor direct-payment request (B2G only).
    - BG-4 SELLER  = SUBCONTRACTOR (SOUS-TRAITANT)
    - BG-7 BUYER = PUBLIC BUYER
    - EXT-FR-FE-BG-03 SELLER AGENT = MAIN CONTRACTOR / contract holder
    - VAT reverse charge (autoliquidation) applies to construction subcontracting:
      BT-118 = AE, BT-110 = 0, BT-121 = VATEX-FR-AE, BT-120 = AUTOLIQUIDATION
      (CGI art. 283-2 nonies - the MAIN CONTRACTOR self-assesses the VAT)
    - BT-11 Project reference carries the construction site (chantier) for grouping with other
      subcontractor invoices toward the FINAL BUYER.

    Worked figures (per spec illustration, F1 autoliquidated):
    - Total HT (BT-109)  = 25 000.00 EUR
    - Total VAT (BT-110) = 0.00 EUR (autoliquidation)
    - Total TTC (BT-112) = 25 000.00 EUR

    French Text Codes (BT-21/BT-22):
    - #REG#: Company legal form and share capital
    - #ABL#: Trade register number (RCS)
    - #AAI#: Subcontracting / direct payment / autoliquidation explanation
    - #PMD#: Late payment penalties
    - #PMT#: Fixed collection costs indemnity (40 EUR)
    - #ADN#B2G: Chorus Pro B2G indicator

    Reference: AIFE Chorus Pro qualification scenario 1.7; XP Z12-012 V1.4 CPRO-21/23.
-->
